  "_Not connected_: nothing has arrived for this database yet. _Disconnected_: the agent reported, then sent nothing for at least 15 minutes. Either way, run the diagnostic script from step 3 where the agent runs — it names the most likely problem. Also check that `DATABASE_SERVER_ID` is this database's id, `4f7f2c9e-0000-4000-8000-000000000001`: the data joins it only when the id names a database in the project the ingestion key belongs to.":
    "_未連線_：此資料庫還沒有收到任何資料。_已中斷_：代理程式曾經回報過，之後至少 15 分鐘沒有傳送任何資料。無論哪種情況，都請在代理程式執行的地方執行第 3 步的診斷指令碼——它會指出最可能的問題。也請檢查 `DATABASE_SERVER_ID` 是否為此資料庫的 ID `4f7f2c9e-0000-4000-8000-000000000001`：只有當該 ID 指向擷取金鑰所屬專案中的資料庫時，資料才會連結到它。",
